    "Id": "mechdef_mackie_MSK-9HKR",
    "Name": "Mackie MSK-9HKR",
    "Details": "The unofficial mascot of the Desert Wars portion of the Martial Olympiad, Kill Roy uses two LB 10-X autocannons instead of the single AC/20. Two tons of ammunition are stored in each side torso. For protection, the torsos are equipped with CASE. To make room for these, the Beagle Active Probe has been removed. Thirteen Double Heat Sinks keep the 'Mech running.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.2</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Upper</color>",
